data: {"model_request":{"messages":[{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants an algorithm visualization for 0/1 Knapsack DP. This matches the ALGORITHM branch. I need to:\n\n1. Call plan_visualization with technology=\"SVG/d3\" and key_elements\n2. Immediately call render_algorithm with all steps computed\n\nLet me compute the DP table for:\n- weights = [2, 3, 4]\n- values = [3, 4, 5]\n- capacity = 6\n\nDP table: dp[i][w] = max value using first i items with capacity w\n\nItems: 0(2,3), 1(3,4), 2(4,5)\n\ndp[0][0..6] = 0 (no items)\ndp[0][0]=0, dp[0][1]=0, dp[0][2]=0, dp[0][3]=0, dp[0][4]=0, dp[0][5]=0, dp[0][6]=0\n\nItem 0 (w=2, v=3):\ndp[1][0]=0, dp[1][1]=0\ndp[1][2] = max(dp[0][2], dp[0][0]+3) = max(0, 3) = 3\ndp[1][3] = max(dp[0][3], dp[0][1]+3) = max(0, 3) = 3\ndp[1][4] = max(dp[0][4], dp[0][2]+3) = max(0, 3) = 3\ndp[1][5] = max(dp[0][5], dp[0][3]+3) = max(0, 3) = 3\ndp[1][6] = max(dp[0][6], dp[0][4]+3) = max(0, 3) = 3\n\nItem 1 (w=3, v=4):\ndp[2][0]=0, dp[2][1]=0, dp[2][2]=3\ndp[2][3] = max(dp[1][3], dp[1][0]+4) = max(3, 4) = 4\n\n\ndp[2][4] = max(dp[1][4], dp[1][1]+4) = max(3, 4) = 4\ndp[2][5] = max(dp[1][5], dp[1][2]+4) = max(3, 3+4=7) = 7\ndp[2][6] = max(dp[1][6], dp[1][3]+4) = max(3, 3+4=7) = 7\n\nItem 2 (w=4, v=5):\ndp[3][0]=0, dp[3][1]=0, dp[3][2]=3, dp[3][3]=4\ndp[3][4] = max(dp[2][4], dp[2][0]+5) = max(4, 5) = 5\ndp[3][5] = max(dp[2][5], dp[2][1]+5) = max(7, 5) = 7\ndp[3][6] = max(dp[2][6], dp[2][2]+5) = max(7, 3+5=8) = 8\n\nThe maximum value achievable is 8, found in the final cell dp[3][6].\n\nNow I need to create the step-by-step visualization for the DP table. I'm setting up the table structure with items as rows (including a base case row) and capacities 0 through 6 as columns. The final answer sits at position [3][6], which will be highlighted as the result.\n\nThe visualization requires showing each DP cell computation sequentially, where each step displays the current values in the table, highlights which cells are being compared, and explains whether we're including or excluding the current item. I need to generate all 21 computational steps systematically to trace through the entire algorithm.","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_3a3ccb98a5c141f58152934b","function":{"arguments":"{\"technology\": \"SVG/d3\", \"approach\": \"Step-by-step DP table animation for 0/1 knapsack. Each step highlights the current cell, shows include/exclude formula, and updates the table progressively.\", \"key_elements\": \"[\\\"DP table 4×8 (rows=items, cols=capacity 0..6)\\\", \\\"Current cell highlight with include/exclude formula\\\", \\\"Pointers: item index i and capacity w\\\", \\\"Final answer dp[3][6]=8 with path reconstruction hint\\\"]\"}","name":"plan_visualization"},"type":"function"}]},"response_metadata":{"model_provider":"openai","usage":{"completion_tokens":4096,"prompt_tokens":15077,"total_tokens":19173,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":873},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":14336}}},"tool_call_chunks":[{"name":"plan_visualization","args":"{\"technology\": \"SVG/d3\", \"approach\": \"Step-by-step DP table animation for 0/1 knapsack. Each step highlights the current cell, shows include/exclude formula, and updates the table progressively.\", \"key_elements\": \"[\\\"DP table 4×8 (rows=items, cols=capacity 0..6)\\\", \\\"Current cell highlight with include/exclude formula\\\", \\\"Pointers: item index i and capacity w\\\", \\\"Final answer dp[3][6]=8 with path reconstruction hint\\\"]\"}","id":"call_3a3ccb98a5c141f58152934b","index":0,"type":"tool_call_chunk"}],"tool_calls":[{"name":"plan_visualization","args":{"technology":"SVG/d3","approach":"Step-by-step DP table animation for 0/1 knapsack. Each step highlights the current cell, shows include/exclude formula, and updates the table progressively.","key_elements":"[\"DP table 4×8 (rows=items, cols=capacity 0..6)\", \"Current cell highlight with include/exclude formula\", \"Pointers: item index i and capacity w\