data: {"model_request":{"messages":[{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"reasoning_content":"Now I need to compute all the steps. Let me think through each cell computation carefully.\n\nItems:\n- Item 0: weight=2, value=3\n- Item 1: weight=3, value=4\n- Item 2: weight=4, value=5\n- Capacity = 6\n\nDP table (i × w):\n```\n       w=0  w=1  w=2  w=3  w=4  w=5  w=6\ni=0  [  0,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0]\ni=1  [  0,   0,   3,   3,   3,   3,   3]\ni=2  [  0,   0,   3,   4,   4,   7,   7]\ni=3  [  0,   0,   3,   4,   5,   7,   8]\n```\n\nNow I'll compute each step. For each cell [i][w] (where i > 0):\n- If w < weights[i-1]: dp[i][w] = dp[i-1][w] (exclude, can't fit)\n- Otherwise: dp[i][w] = max(dp[i-1][w], dp[i-1][w-weights[i-1]] + values[i-1])\n\nStep 1: i=0 (base row) - show all zeros\nStep 2: i=1, w=0 → w < 2, exclude → 0\nStep 3: i=1, w=1 → w < 2, exclude → 0\nStep 4: i=1, w=2 → w >= 2, max(0, 0+3) = 3, include\nStep 5: i=1, w=3 → w >= 2, max(0, 0+3) = 3, include\n\n\nStep 6: i=1, w=4 → w >= 2, max(0, 0+3) = 3, include\nStep 7: i=1, w=5 → w >= 2, max(0, 0+3) = 3, include\nStep 8: i=1, w=6 → w >= 2, max(0, 0+3) = 3, include\nStep 9: i=2, w=0 → w < 3, exclude → 0\nStep 10: i=2, w=1 → w < 3, exclude → 0\nStep 11: i=2, w=2 → w < 3, exclude → 3\nStep 12: i=2, w=3 → w >= 3, max(3, 0+4) = 4, include\nStep 13: i=2, w=4 → w >= 3, max(3, 0+4) = 4, include\nStep 14: i=2, w=5 → w >= 3, max(3, 3+4) = 7, include\nStep 15: i=2, w=6 → w >= 3, max(3, 3+4) = 7, include\nStep 16: i=3, w=0 → w < 4, exclude → 0\nStep 17: i=3, w=1 → w < 4, exclude → 0\nStep 18: i=3, w=2 → w < 4, exclude → 3\nStep 19: i=3, w=3 → w < 4, exclude → 4\nStep 20: i=3, w=4 → w >= 4, max(4, 0+5) = 5, include\nStep 21: i=3, w=5 → w >= 4, max(7, 0+5) = 7, exclude\nStep 22: i=3, w=6 → w >= 4, max(7, 3+5) = 8, include\n\nNow I need to construct the render_algorithm call with proper step-by-step format."},"response_metadata":{"model_provider":"openai","usage":{"completion_tokens":4096,"prompt_tokens":16197,"total_tokens":20293,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":943},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":15040}}},"tool_call_chunks":[],"tool_calls":[],"id":"328b8bd90969465b9f49242096980986","usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":16197,"output_tokens":4096,"total_tokens":20293,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":15040},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":943}},"invalid_tool_calls":[],"name":"primoria-tutor","type":"ai"}]}}
